# 📋 Project Management Tool

A collaborative project management web application developed as part of my **CodeAlpha Full Stack Development Internship**.

## 🚀 Features

- User authentication
- Create group projects
- Assign tasks
- Project boards
- Task cards
- Comments and communication within tasks
- User, project, task, and comment management
- Real-time notifications and updates using WebSockets

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Full Stack Development
- WebSockets
- Backend database

